    </li> <li> <para-num num="[0093]"> </para-num> <div id="p-0088" num="0093" class="description-line">While the invention has been described in detail and with reference to specific embodiments thereof, it will be apparent to one skilled in the art that various changes and modifications can be made therein without departing from the spirit and scope thereof. To cite only one of many possible examples, the ultra high molecular weight polyethylene can be replaced with a high-density polyethylene or a mixture of two or three ultra high molecular weight polyethylene and high-density polyethylene or other polyolefins, polyolefin copolymers or derivatives thereof and the kaolin filler or the mixture of Al<sub>2</sub>O<sub>3 </sub>and SiO<sub>2 </sub>can be replaced by other suitable and property enhancing stable fillers.</div>
    
  </li> </ul>
  </div>
  </section>

  <section itemprop="claims" itemscope>
    <h2>Claims (<span itemprop="count">25</span>)</h2>
    
    <div itemprop="content" html><div mxw-id="PCLM38327896" lang="EN" load-source="patent-office" class="claims">
    <div class="claim"> <div id="CLM-00001" num="00001" class="claim">
      <div class="claim-text"> <b>1</b>. (canceled)</div>
    </div>
    </div> <div class="claim-dependent"> <div id="CLM-00002" num="00002" class="claim">
      <div class="claim-text"> <b>2</b>. The lithium ion battery of <claim-ref idref="CLM-00016">claim 16</claim-ref> wherein the kaolin clay further comprises calcined kaolin.</div>
    </div>
    </div> <div class="claim-dependent"> <div id="CLM-00003" num="00003" class="claim">
      <div class="claim-text"> <b>3</b>. The lithium ion battery of <claim-ref idref="CLM-00002">claim 2</claim-ref> wherein the polyolefin further comprises an ultra-high molecular weight polyethylene (UHMWPE) having a minimum average molecular weight of 1×10(PWR)6.</div>
    </div>
    </div> <div class="claim-dependent"> <div id="CLM-00004" num="00004" class="claim">
      <div class="claim-text"> <b>4</b>. The lithium ion battery in accordance with <claim-ref idref="CLM-00002">claim 2</claim-ref>, wherein the polyolefin in is a mixture of UHMWPE having a minimum average molecular weight of 1×10(pwr)6 and a polypropylene (PP) having a melt index of 2 or less, and wherein the weight ratio of UHMWPE to PP is 50% or more.</div>
    </div>
    </div> <div class="claim-dependent"> <div id="CLM-00005" num="00005" class="claim">
      <div class="claim-text"> <b>5</b>. The lithium ion battery of <claim-ref idref="CLM-00016">claim 16</claim-ref>, or <b>2</b>, or <b>3</b> or <b>4</b> wherein the weight percentage ratio of the kaolin clay in the mix is between 20% and 80%, and wherein the separator is not subject to shutdown, regardless of temperature.</div>
    </div>
    </div> <div class="claim-dependent"> <div id="CLM-00006" num="00006" class="claim">
      <div class="claim-text"> <b>6</b>. The lithium ion battery in accordance with <claim-ref idref="CLM-00016">claim 16</claim-ref>, or <b>2</b>, or <b>3</b>, or <b>4</b>, wherein said macroporous membrane has a melt integrity of 150° C. or higher.</div>
    </div>
    </div> <div class="claim-dependent"> <div id="CLM-00007" num="00007" class="claim">
      <div class="claim-text"> <b>7</b>. The lithium ion battery in accordance with <claim-ref idref="CLM-00002">claim 2</claim-ref> wherein the weight percent of calcined kaolin in the mixture is between 5% and 20%, and wherein the polyolefin comprises a mixture of 10% to 50% by weight of UHMWPE having minimum average molecular weight of 1 million and 40% to 70% by weight of high density polyethylene having an average an average molecular weight of between 300,000 and 800,000.</div>
    </div>
    </div> <div class="claim-dependent"> <div id="CLM-00008" num="00008" class="claim">
      <div class="claim-text"> <b>8</b>. The lithium ion battery of <claim-ref idref="CLM-00007">claim 7</claim-ref> that has shutdown activation between 130° C. and 190° C.</div>
    </div>
    </div> <div class="claim-dependent"> <div id="CLM-00009" num="00009" class="claim">
      <div class="claim-text"> <b>9</b>. The lithium ion battery of <claim-ref idref="CLM-00007">claim 7</claim-ref>, wherein its melt integrity is 150° C. or higher.</div>
    </div>
    </div> <div class="claim"> <div id="CLM-00010" num="00010" class="claim">
      <div class="claim-text"> <b>10</b>. (canceled)</div>
    </div>
    </div> <div class="claim"> <div id="CLM-00011" num="00011" class="claim">
      <div class="claim-text"> <b>11</b>. (canceled)</div>
    </div>
    </div> <div class="claim"> <div id="CLM-00012" num="00012" class="claim">
      <div class="claim-text"> <b>12</b>. (canceled)</div>
    </div>
    </div> <div class="claim"> <div id="CLM-00013" num="00013" class="claim">
      <div class="claim-text"> <b>13</b>. (canceled)</div>
    </div>
    </div> <div class="claim-dependent"> <div id="CLM-00014" num="00014" class="claim">
      <div class="claim-text"> <b>14</b>. The lithium ion battery in accordance with <claim-ref idref="CLM-00005">claim 5</claim-ref>, wherein said microporous membrane has a melt integrity of 150° C. or higher.</div>
    </div>
    </div> <div class="claim"> <div id="CLM-00015" num="00015" class="claim">
      <div class="claim-text"> <b>15</b>. A lithium ion battery comprising:
<div class="claim-text">a non-aqueous electrolyte comprising a lithium salt; and</div> <div class="claim-text">a battery separator comprising a microporous membrane;</div> <div class="claim-text">the battery separator having only a single layer, and comprising a mixture of between 10% and 80% kaolin clay and of polyolefin, the battery separator having a thickness of between 20 and 250 microns.</div> </div>
    </div>
    </div> <div class="claim-dependent"> <div id="CLM-00016" num="00016" class="claim">
      <div class="claim-text"> <b>16</b>. The lithium ion battery of <claim-ref idref="CLM-00015">claim 15</claim-ref>, wherein the battery separator has a thickness of between 30 and 70 microns.</div>
    </div>
    </div> <div class="claim"> <div id="CLM-00017" num="00017" class="claim">
      <div class="claim-text"> <b>17</b>. (canceled)</div>
    </div>
    </div> <div class="claim-dependent"> <div id="CLM-00018" num="00018" class="claim">
      <div class="claim-text"> <b>18</b>. The lithium ion battery of <claim-ref idref="CLM-00017">claim 17</claim-ref> or <claim-ref idref="CLM-00002">2</claim-ref> wherein the kaolin clay contains a nominal amount of 39.68% by weight Aluminum oxide (Al<sub>2</sub>O<sub>3</sub>).</div>
    </div>
    </div> <div class="claim-dependent"> <div id="CLM-00019" num="00019" class="claim">
      <div class="claim-text"> <b>19</b>. The lithium ion battery of <claim-ref idref="CLM-00017">claim 17</claim-ref> or <claim-ref idref="CLM-00002">2</claim-ref> wherein the kaolin clay contains a nominal amount of 56.91 Silicon dioxide (SiO<sub>2</sub>).</div>
    </div>
    </div> <div class="claim-dependent"> <div id="CLM-00020" num="00020" class="claim">
      <div class="claim-text"> <b>20</b>. The lithium ion battery of <claim-ref idref="CLM-00017">claim 17</claim-ref> or <claim-ref idref="CLM-00002">2</claim-ref> where in the kaolin clay is a blend of Aluminum oxide (Al<sub>2</sub>O<sub>3</sub>) and Silicon dioxide (SiO<sub>2</sub>).</div>
    </div>
    </div> <div class="claim-dependent"> <div id="CLM-00021" num="00021" class="claim">
      <div class="claim-text"> <b>21</b>. The lithium ion battery of <claim-ref idref="CLM-00015">claim 15</claim-ref>, wherein the separator is sufficiently flexible to be used in a lithium-ion battery.</div>
    </div>
    </div> <div class="claim"> <div id="CLM-00022" num="00022" class="claim">
      <div class="claim-text"> <b>22</b>. A lithium ion battery comprising:
<div class="claim-text">a non-aqueous electrolyte comprising a lithium salt; and</div> <div class="claim-text">a battery separator comprising a microporous membrane, the battery separator having only a single layer, and comprising, by weight:</div> <div class="claim-text">50% kaolin clay; and</div> <div class="claim-text">50% UHMW polyethylene.</div> </div>
    </div>
    </div> <div class="claim-dependent"> <div id="CLM-00023" num="00023" class="claim">
      <div class="claim-text"> <b>23</b>. The lithium ion battery of <claim-ref idref="CLM-00022">claim 22</claim-ref>, wherein the kaolin clay has a density of 2.6 gr/cm<sup>3</sup>.</div>
    </div>
    </div> <div class="claim-dependent"> <div id="CLM-00024" num="00024" class="claim">
      <div class="claim-text"> <b>24</b>. The lithium ion battery of <claim-ref idref="CLM-00023">claim 23</claim-ref> wherein the UHMW polyethylene has a Mw of 1×10<sup>6</sup>,</div>
    </div>
    </div> <div class="claim-dependent"> <div id="CLM-00025" num="00025" class="claim">
      <div class="claim-text"> <b>25</b>. The lithium ion battery of <claim-ref idref="CLM-00024">claim 24</claim-ref>, wherein the battery separator has a thickness of 25 microns.</div>
    </div>
  </div> </div>
  </div>
  </section>

